  "guardrails": [
    "Kinematics are not kinetics.",
    "A hip midpoint is a body-centre proxy, not true whole-body COM.",
    "Foot strike is a descriptor, not a correctness score.",
    "Cadence has no universal 180 steps/min pass threshold.",
    "Asymmetry is not dysfunction.",
    "Running economy cannot be measured from pose video alone.",
    "No force, stiffness, injury, diagnosis, muscle-state, or fascial-state claim may be generated from ordinary monocular pose video."
